      ],
      "text": "Coordination primitives include TTL'd named locks (clu lock with auto-release), fire-and-forget inter-agent messaging (clu ping / clu inbox), git worktree bootstrapping, and an experimental clu sync that stores issue state as JSONL on a refs/clu/store git ref."
